# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT
# ============================================================
#
# Never commit:
# - .env
# - API keys
# - Telegram tokens
# - WhatsApp access tokens
# - encryption keys
# - database files
# - browser session profiles
# - uploaded private files
#
# ============================================================
